      "text": "Lamanites to be scourge unto Nephites, 1 Ne. 2:24 (2 Ne. 5:25; Jacob 3:3). world shall scourge God when he comes, 1 Ne. 19:9 (2 Ne. 6:9; Mosiah 3:9). Jews to be scourged by all people for crucifying God, 1 Ne. 19:13 (2 Ne. 25:16). the Son will suffer himself to be scourged, Mosiah 15:5. wicked priests scourged Abinadi, Mosiah 17:13. Gentiles to be scourge to descendants of Nephites, 3 Ne. 20:28.",
